OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, bright start across the
OL,6,Fregion. Cloud builds through the day
OL,7,Fbut remaining dry with hazy sunshine.
OL,8,FFeeling warm in the sun by mid
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds freshening across the
OL,10,FDales and the Moors through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFine and partly cloudy into
OL,13,Fthe evening. Clear spells linger
OL,14,Fovernight leading to the odd patch of
OL,15,Fmist and fog developing. Cloud
OL,16,Fbuilding late on. Milder than last
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
