OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloud builds through the
OL,6,Fmorning with a band of light rain
OL,7,Fmoving across the area during the
OL,8,Fafternoon, then clearing through the
OL,9,Fevening. Temperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDrier
OL,12,Fand brighter through Saturday. A
OL,13,Fbreezy day on Sunday, with rain
OL,14,Farriving later after a fine start to
OL,15,Fthe day. A further fine day on Monday.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
